physicalRef: logistics_links
description: "Logistics cargo theft Link Analysis showcase - ONE link Dataset built by the logistics_links Job from carrier, driver, place, shipment, trip, stop, warehouse_scan and loss_report. kind is one of drove, co_drove, scanned_by, stopped_at, carried_by, lost, same_phone; one row per pair; via names the evidence. Ids say what an endpoint is: DRV- driver, TR- trip (its shipment is SH- with the same number), EMP- warehouse employee, PL- place on the road, CAR- carrier, LR- loss report. Synthetic."
